'''Leer Cast''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Festival Mask}}.

==Mechanics==
Equipping Leer Cast applies a special [[aura]] buff "{{stl|Damage Aura}}" that affects the player character and nearby [[Ally|allies]]. This bonus applies to ''all'' damage, including that of [[spell]]s, [[trap]]s, and [[totem]]s.

Like other similar effects (aura granted by item but not an aura ''skill'' granted by item), the aura buff won't be affected by any of the player character's aura bonuses, however, the effects will stack with other party members also equipped with Leer Cast.<ref name=stack/>

However, since the item also has another mod {{c|mod|25% reduced Damage}} the net effect would be 25% increased Damage for the player character and 50% increased damage for the nearby allies. increase/reduce mods are additive to each other.

